<title>USA: Sullivan Dental to acquire firm.</title>
<headline>Sullivan Dental to acquire firm.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ALLIS, Wis. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sullivan Dental Products Inc, a dental supply and equipment distributor, said Monday it agreed in principle to purchase all the assets and assume substantially all of the liabilities of Jennifer de St. Georges &amp; Associates Inc, a practice management company.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;The acquisition will allow both companies to jointly develop expanded management programs for dentists to better handle the business aspects of their practices, &quot; Tim Sullivan, president, said in a statement.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
